{"id":"4dc378608fdc49c6","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-ae.md","title":"Almost Everywhere","display":"df-ae — Almost Everywhere","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ae","aliases":["58-df-ae"],"display":"df-ae — Almost Everywhere","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ae"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ae</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ae — Almost Everywhere"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mu,f,g\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mu,f,g\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AEEqual}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{AEEqual}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AEEqual}_S(f,g,X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\n\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AEEqual}_S(f,g,X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\n\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Almost everywhere equality ignores null sets.</li>\n<li>The carrier, sigma algebra, codomain, and measure are explicit arguments, so nullity cannot be witnessed in a different measure space sharing the same measure graph.</li>\n<li>It is fundamental in measure theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mu,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AEEqual}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AEEqual}_S(f,g,X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\n\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0","display":true}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ae.md|58-df-ae]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["83a15c7e9b3817dc","36d7463d215be751"]}